=== Using Arrays as Sets ===

Initial set:
  apple
  banana
  cherry

Membership tests:
  apple is in the set
  grape is NOT in the set

Adding 'grape' to set
  grape is now in the set

Removing 'banana' from set
  banana is NOT in the set (removed)

Toggle operations:
  Removing cherry
  Adding orange

Final set:
  apple
  grape
  orange

=== Set Operations ===
Set1:  ["a", "b", "c"]
Set2:  ["b", "c", "d"]
Union:  ["a", "b", "c", "d"]
Intersection:  ["b", "c"]
Difference:  ["a"]
